    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the pilot's seat</strong>, surrounded by the roar of impending doom, you, a Marras's pilot, weave through a relentless barrage of plasma bullets. Each maneuver is a bold defiance against annihilation. Every shot marks a desperate struggle for survival in a technological apocalypse. Your ship slices through the turbulent clouds in a nerve-wracking chase where each heartbeat could be humanity's last or ignite its fierce resistance against extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/01d0001d7a542faefeebf16f4f214c97.poster.avif?t=1751959957\" width=608 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/01d0001d7a542faefeebf16f4f214c97.webm?t=1751959957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/01d0001d7a542faefeebf16f4f214c97.mp4?t=1751959957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/e5b81ec509b79273c9fbf1c774686ddc.poster.avif?t=1751959957\" width=609 height=337 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/e5b81ec509b79273c9fbf1c774686ddc.webm?t=1751959957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay and Aesthetic Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode:</strong> Over 100 hand-crafted levels, with precision platformer-like progression. Ideal for new players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> 5-stage structure for veterans, featuring a deep scoring system based on items and resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Mode:</strong> Teaches essential skills with clear goals, detailed guidance, and engaging visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice Mode:</strong> Focused on mastering Arcade Mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD sprite graphics with an industrial sci-fi look, including intricate bosses and diverse enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marras is challenging yet fair. Campaign Mode is less punishing than traditional arcade shooters. Arcade Mode offers the challenge that a seasoned player can expect.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the pilot's seat</strong>, surrounded by the roar of impending doom, you, a Marras's pilot, weave through a relentless barrage of plasma bullets. Each maneuver is a bold defiance against annihilation. Every shot marks a desperate struggle for survival in a technological apocalypse. Your ship slices through the turbulent clouds in a nerve-wracking chase where each heartbeat could be humanity's last or ignite its fierce resistance against extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/01d0001d7a542faefeebf16f4f214c97.poster.avif?t=1751959957\" width=608 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/01d0001d7a542faefeebf16f4f214c97.webm?t=1751959957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/01d0001d7a542faefeebf16f4f214c97.mp4?t=1751959957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/e5b81ec509b79273c9fbf1c774686ddc.poster.avif?t=1751959957\" width=609 height=337 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439240/extras/e5b81ec509b79273c9fbf1c774686ddc.webm?t=1751959957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay and Aesthetic Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode:</strong> Over 100 hand-crafted levels, with precision platformer-like progression. Ideal for new players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Mode:</strong> 5-stage structure for veterans, featuring a deep scoring system based on items and resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Mode:</strong> Teaches essential skills with clear goals, detailed guidance, and engaging visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice Mode:</strong> Focused on mastering Arcade Mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD sprite graphics with an industrial sci-fi look, including intricate bosses and diverse enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marras is challenging yet fair. Campaign Mode is less punishing than traditional arcade shooters. Arcade Mode offers the challenge that a seasoned player can expect.</p></li></ul>",
